---
title: Chat and Delegation Flow
---
flowchart TB
    User([User message]) --> API[Chat API]
    API --> Supervisor{MainSupervisorAgent<br/>deterministic routing}

    Supervisor -->|presentation| Presentation[Queue durable<br/>PresentationAgent job]
    Presentation --> Progress[Return job ID<br/>and background progress]

    Supervisor -->|diagram| Diagram[DiagramAgent]
    Diagram --> Inference[Provider-neutral<br/>inference adapter]
    Inference -->|diagram role| DiagramModel[Qwen 3.5 9B<br/>diagram call]
    DiagramModel --> Artifact[Validate and persist<br/>Mermaid artifact]

    Supervisor -->|ordinary chat| Memory[MemoryCoordinatorAgent<br/>bounded retrieval]
    Memory --> Optional{Need a tool<br/>or current web data?}
    Optional -->|tool| MCP[MCP selection<br/>and safety gates]
    Optional -->|web| Search[Privacy-screened<br/>internet search]
    Optional -->|neither| Context[Curated context]
    MCP --> Context
    Search --> Context

    Context --> Inference
    Inference -->|main role| Main[Qwen 3.5 9B<br/>streaming assistant call]
    Main --> Persist[Persist completed turn<br/>and lifecycle updates]
    Persist --> Stream[SSE response]

    Artifact --> Stream
    Progress --> Stream
    Stream --> UI[Visible answer, artifact,<br/>tool/search status, or job progress]

    Failure[Sanitized failure] -.-> Stream

